`opentelemetry-instrumentation-aiokafka`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-confluent-kafka`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-kafka-python`: emit `messaging.kafka.cluster.id` on producer and consumer spans. `ConfluentKafkaInstrumentor.instrument_producer()` and `instrument_consumer()` accept an optional `bootstrap_servers`; a manually instrumented client needs it, because a `confluent_kafka` client exposes no configuration of its own
